{
  "name": "Text to Video - MiniMax H3",
  "author": "InvokeAI",
  "description": "Text-to-video generation with MiniMax H3 (FL2VA). Produces an MP4 with a jointly generated AAC stereo soundtrack: `num_frames` frames at the model's fixed 24 fps (default 124 frames = ~5.2 s at 1344x768).",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "contact": "",
  "tags": "minimax h3, text to video, video, audio",
  "notes": "This workflow needs the MiniMax H3 FL2VA model (diffusers layout). Each InvokeAI install assigns its own internal model IDs, so the model field is left blank -- select your installed MiniMax H3 model in the form after loading.\n\nMiniMax H3 generates video and a synchronized stereo soundtrack together; the soundtrack is muxed into the MP4 automatically (AAC, 32 kHz). The frame rate is fixed at 24 fps and frame counts snap to a 17n+5 grid: 124 frames = ~5.2 s, up to 345 frames = 14.4 s. Width/height must be multiples of 32; the native canvas is a 768 px short edge (max 768x1344).\n\nThe model is guidance-distilled: no negative prompt, no CFG. Steps counts sigma grid points; 50 is the reference default.",
